' M3b 0.0.4 - ten-cycle opening/closing smoke test.
' Check available Chip RAM before and after for leaks.
For _I=1 To 10
   _OK=Aga Screen Open(320,256,32,$00021000)
   Print "CYCLE ";_I;" OPEN=";_OK
   If _OK<>0
      Aga Screen Pattern
      Aga Screen Close
   End If
Next _I
Print "END OF TEN CYCLES"
Wait Key
End
